---
id: R4806000
title: "The lethal solver keeps two placements of a play apart when they differ in lane, so a lethal that stands in the second lane is found and the hint lights (issue #4806)"
cards: "§9.9, #45, S #157, R1849005, R2102000, R2660000, R3554003, R4132000, R4447000, issue #1797"
proven_in:
